{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 6175934784700604701,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Installing open-source tools for ARTIX-7 FPGAs",
      "source_hash": 1731716009386248761,
      "context_hash": 4452906761171241301,
      "translation": "ARTIX-7 FPGA용 오픈소스 도구 설치하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266588Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "There are two possible toolchains for ARTIX-7, either symbiflow (all-in-one, integrated, easier to install) or yosys + xray + nextpnr-xilinx (more complicated to install, but more up to date, and uses nextpnr instead of the heavier vpr).",
      "source_hash": 18162587889844100522,
      "context_hash": 5070833074410317954,
      "translation": "ARTIX-7에는 두 가지 가능한 툴체인이 있는데, 하나는 symbiflow(올인원, 통합형이며 설치가 더 쉬움)이고 다른 하나는 yosys + xray + nextpnr-xilinx(설치가 더 복잡하지만 더 최신이며, 더 무거운 vpr 대신 nextpnr을 사용함)입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266589Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Yosys/NextPNR/ProjectXRay",
      "source_hash": 5595874497006074762,
      "context_hash": 5983186154291313298,
      "translation": "Yosys/NextPNR/ProjectXRay",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266589Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 1: yosys",
      "source_hash": 9482842004581966268,
      "context_hash": 12768815790137349617,
      "translation": "1단계: yosys",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266589Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Follow setup instructions from [yosys website](https://github.com/YosysHQ/yosys)",
      "source_hash": 376389351912840386,
      "context_hash": 14247027676137470663,
      "translation": "[yosys 웹사이트](https://github.com/YosysHQ/yosys)의 설치 안내를 따르십시오",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266589Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "*TL;DR*",
      "source_hash": 1618568810526966615,
      "context_hash": 15494556234641637871,
      "translation": "*요약*",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266589Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Install prerequisites:",
      "source_hash": 17853274789325539171,
      "context_hash": 12774252625339385604,
      "translation": "필수 요건 설치하기:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266589Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "If you want the GUI, you will need also to install:",
      "source_hash": 1358897895021774744,
      "context_hash": 10315968745995889707,
      "translation": "GUI를 원한다면 다음도 설치해야 합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266590Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Get the sources:",
      "source_hash": 7476341882289373044,
      "context_hash": 18112703627843462595,
      "translation": "소스 받기:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266590Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Compile and install it:",
      "source_hash": 8854385471840846631,
      "context_hash": 8471070655082718167,
      "translation": "컴파일 후 설치하기:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266590Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 2: prjxray",
      "source_hash": 10736131572790064909,
      "context_hash": 6449076031151787562,
      "translation": "2단계: prjxray",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266590Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Either generate the database (but you need Vivado) or use a pre-generated one.",
      "source_hash": 10334009505974059951,
      "context_hash": 6515107887069725267,
      "translation": "데이터베이스를 직접 생성하거나(단, Vivado가 필요합니다) 미리 생성된 것을 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266590Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "OK, let's use the pre-generated one.",
      "source_hash": 9813289239631065181,
      "context_hash": 9734923386214764026,
      "translation": "좋습니다, 미리 생성된 것을 사용합시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266590Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Follow the README from [prjxray](https://github.com/SymbiFlow/prjxray).",
      "source_hash": 4369006988179710924,
      "context_hash": 11118159704252070249,
      "translation": "[prjxray](https://github.com/SymbiFlow/prjxray)의 README를 따르십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266590Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "*TL;DR*",
      "source_hash": 1618568810526966615,
      "context_hash": 15168952185489075333,
      "translation": "*요약*",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266590Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 3: nextpnr-xilinx",
      "source_hash": 14448222574913930719,
      "context_hash": 17638793554251936577,
      "translation": "3단계: nextpnr-xilinx",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266590Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Did not manage to build it with the gui, because on my box it gives a missing symbol error in boost-python, so I deactivated it.",
      "source_hash": 13863914688555010015,
      "context_hash": 14152220397911923897,
      "translation": "제 컴퓨터에서는 boost-python에서 심볼 누락 오류가 발생해서 GUI로는 빌드하지 못했으므로 비활성화했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266590Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "One more thing, you will need to generate the chipdb (whatever that means, I do not understand everything here...).",
      "source_hash": 16477316511635000258,
      "context_hash": 13358313538804306437,
      "translation": "한 가지 더, chipdb를 생성해야 합니다(그게 무슨 의미인지 여기서 모든 걸 이해하지는 못했습니다만…).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266590Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Learnt that from the 'building the Arty example' of [this webpage](https://github.com/gatecat/nextpnr-xilinx)).",
      "source_hash": 13903107429416083272,
      "context_hash": 13454068333108347840,
      "translation": "[이 웹페이지](https://github.com/gatecat/nextpnr-xilinx)의 'building the Arty example'에서 이를 배웠습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266590Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "Needs to be adapted if you have a 100t instead of 35t.",
      "source_hash": 540262026858860514,
      "context_hash": 9227157393878908867,
      "translation": "100t를 사용하는 경우 35t 대신 이에 맞게 조정해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266590Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Now set `$PRJXRAY` and `$LEARN_FPGA` in your `.bashrc` and make sure `$PRJXRAY/utils/` is in the `PATH` (so that `fasm2frames.py` is found).",
      "source_hash": 7242373660661811673,
      "context_hash": 8317556999386608209,
      "translation": "이제 `.bashrc`에 `$PRJXRAY`와 `$LEARN_FPGA`를 설정하고, `$PRJXRAY/utils/`가 `PATH`에 포함되어 있는지 확인하십시오(그래야 `fasm2frames.py`를 찾을 수 있습니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266590Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Here we go !",
      "source_hash": 14779045948401898679,
      "context_hash": 8902049600845585804,
      "translation": "자, 갑니다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266591Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "Now time to",
      "source_hash": 15349643059190286011,
      "context_hash": 16376354933935143801,
      "translation": "이제 다음을 할 시간입니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266591Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "install openFPGALoader (at the end of [the general toolchain tutorial](toolchain.md))",
      "source_hash": 11846463995799541837,
      "context_hash": 11062867446354180560,
      "translation": "openFPGALoader 설치하기([일반 툴체인 튜토리얼](toolchain.md)의 끝부분에 있음)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266591Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "plug your ARTY",
      "source_hash": 7069341826104434915,
      "context_hash": 12161965370648570441,
      "translation": "ARTY 연결하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266591Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "run `makeit.sh` in [`basic/ARTY/ARTY_blink`](https://github.com/BrunoLevy/learn-fpga/tree/master/Basic/ARTY/ARTY_blink).",
      "source_hash": 4261018010598992036,
      "context_hash": 13016969972709173205,
      "translation": "[`basic/ARTY/ARTY_blink`](https://github.com/BrunoLevy/learn-fpga/tree/master/Basic/ARTY/ARTY_blink)에서 `makeit.sh`를 실행하십시오. 모든 것이 잘 되었다면 화려한 blinky를 보게 될 것입니다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266591Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:9/seg:1",
      "source": "If everything went well, you will see a colorful blinky !",
      "source_hash": 7376201724969065654,
      "context_hash": 6279217652860565383,
      "translation": "모든 것이 잘 되었다면 화려한 blinky를 보게 될 것입니다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266591Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "ALTERNATIVE: SYMBIFLOW",
      "source_hash": 7610242005572121502,
      "context_hash": 13195102687769127069,
      "translation": "대안: SYMBIFLOW",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266591Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Symbiflow documentation is [here](https://symbiflow-examples.readthedocs.io/en/latest/getting-symbiflow.html).",
      "source_hash": 12784692178202180988,
      "context_hash": 1585201645127895315,
      "translation": "Symbiflow 문서는 [여기](https://symbiflow-examples.readthedocs.io/en/latest/getting-symbiflow.html)에 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266591Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 1: Install symbiflow",
      "source_hash": 13971109344733200947,
      "context_hash": 13064319800108236463,
      "translation": "1단계: symbiflow 설치하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:18.266591Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "To do that, a (custom) version of [symbiflow-magic](https://github.com/merledu/symbiflow-magic) is bundled with FemtoRV.",
      "source_hash": 8044308625567871393,
      "context_hash": 10113918107802999553,
      "translation": "이를 위해 [symbiflow-magic](https://github.com/merledu/symbiflow-magic)의 (커스텀) 버전이 FemtoRV에 번들되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FemtoRV": "FemtoRV"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:10.633093Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Symbiflow-magic is a makefile that downloads and configures a pre-compiled version of symbiflow for ARTIX-7.",
      "source_hash": 18139304580931780884,
      "context_hash": 705907813983106769,
      "translation": "Symbiflow-magic은 ARTIX-7용으로 사전 컴파일된 symbiflow 버전을 다운로드하고 설정하는 makefile입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:10.633095Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "The version bundled with FemtoRV fixes a couple of [issues](https://github.com/merledu/symbiflow-magic/issues/1).",
      "source_hash": 799854472484536781,
      "context_hash": 17529770084885836369,
      "translation": "FemtoRV에 번들된 버전은 몇 가지 [이슈](https://github.com/merledu/symbiflow-magic/issues/1)를 수정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FemtoRV": "FemtoRV"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:10.633096Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "It will download and install several packages (takes a while...)",
      "source_hash": 19220316417271489,
      "context_hash": 11664679874415414099,
      "translation": "여러 패키지를 다운로드하고 설치합니다(시간이 좀 걸립니다...).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:10.633096Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 2: post-install step",
      "source_hash": 1484578196471962752,
      "context_hash": 7580742583988476392,
      "translation": "2단계: 설치 후 단계",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:10.633097Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Add anaconda initialization to your shell startup file as follows:",
      "source_hash": 5845282949311283474,
      "context_hash": 4073396797691294325,
      "translation": "다음과 같이 셸 시작 파일에 anaconda 초기화를 추가하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:10.633098Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Add the following line to your shell startup file (`.bashrc` if you use bash).",
      "source_hash": 15174191323768919989,
      "context_hash": 8591175266981606819,
      "translation": "셸 시작 파일(bash를 사용하는 경우 `.bashrc`)에 다음 줄을 추가하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:10.633098Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Start a new terminal window.",
      "source_hash": 3519247102510259958,
      "context_hash": 8167606223927466222,
      "translation": "새 터미널 창을 시작하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:10.633098Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "If everything went well, the prompt should start with `(xc7)`.",
      "source_hash": 11471340742472747588,
      "context_hash": 12650035049034064976,
      "translation": "모든 것이 잘 진행되었다면 프롬프트가 `(xc7)`로 시작해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:10.633098Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Edit `learn_fpga/FemtoRV/Makefile`, comment the line with `arty_yosys_nextpnr.mk` and uncomment the one with `arty35_symbiflow.mk`.",
      "source_hash": 444488538081621479,
      "context_hash": 12638225219397590681,
      "translation": "`learn_fpga/FemtoRV/Makefile`을 편집하여 `arty_yosys_nextpnr.mk`가 있는 줄을 주석 처리하고 `arty35_symbiflow.mk`가 있는 줄의 주석을 해제하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:10.633099Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}